# 6. CORE ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE

The system shall separate:

### Clinical Services

from:

### NCD Disease Workflows.

For example, laboratory services shall not be duplicated for Diabetes, Cardiac Disease and Sickle Cell.

Instead:

```text
Diabetes
    │
    └── Laboratory Request
              │
              └── Laboratory Module

Cardiac
    │
    └── ECG Request
              │
              └── ECG Module

Sickle Cell
    │
    └── Laboratory Request
              │
              └── Laboratory Module
```

The same clinical service may therefore be used by multiple NCD programs.

