```

---

# 32. FOLLOW-UP SCHEDULING MODES

## Automatic

The system generates visits according to predefined rules.

## Manual

Authorized staff create visits manually.

## Hybrid

The system generates future visits automatically while authorized staff can:

* Reschedule
* Add
* Cancel
* Skip
* Change future frequency
* Create unscheduled encounters

---

# 33. ROLLING SCHEDULING

The system shall support rolling generation.

Example:

```text
Frequency = Every 1 Month
Generate Ahead = 3 Months
Maximum Future Visits = 3
```

Initial schedule:

```text
October
November
December
```

After October is completed:

```text
November
December
January
```

The system generates the next missing future visit.

---

# 34. FOLLOW-UP REFERENCE DATE

The system shall support:

* Baseline
* Last completed visit
* Custom date
* Custom month

Example:

```text
Baseline = 10 January
Frequency = Every 3 Months

10 April
10 July
10 October
```

---

