# 68. FOLLOW-UP AUTOMATION ALGORITHM

The system shall periodically:

```text
1. Identify active follow-up plans
2. Identify patients under each plan
3. Determine reference date
4. Find existing future visits
5. Calculate generation window
6. Calculate maximum future visits
7. Generate missing visits
8. Prevent duplicates
9. Never modify completed visits
10. Apply current scheduling rules
11. Record audit information
```

